Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:35.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地心：地壳→上地幔→下地幔→外核→内核）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:44.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地球 很久很久以前）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,进球！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:07.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《冰川时代4：大陆漂移》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.55,0:03:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音，艾丽，你听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that? Ellie, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了，曼尼，别管了，远着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard it, Manny. Whatever it is, it's miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.38,0:03:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃，你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.25,0:03:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.52,0:03:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩可都是喜欢睡懒觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No teenager is ever up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又没关她禁闭，“典狱官”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy warden, she's not on lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这两个叔叔该看紧点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two were supposed to be responsible uncles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.93,0:03:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋了？桃桃15到20分钟前还在啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I didn't see Peaches sneak off maybe 15 or 20 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能和路易斯去瀑布那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that she went with Louis to the falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.47,0:03:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,瀑布？那些小混混出没的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The falls? Where the delinquents go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，去那儿玩的只是些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, it's just where the kids hang out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不，这可是叛逆的不归路\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's a gateway hangout.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:04:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,先是去瀑布那儿，然后是穿鼻洞…\N{\fnArial\fs30}First it's the falls, then she's piercing her trunk…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就要染上莓瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the next thing you know, she's addicted to berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼，你反应过度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny! You are overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子总要长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not going to be your little girl forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，所以我才担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. That's what worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能钻出脑袋，享受享受地面上的乐趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you get your head out of the ground for once and try to have a little fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.14,0:04:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为鼹鼠，我本就该埋头地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a molehog. My head's supposed to be underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.44,0:04:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒死陪你去邂逅小帅哥，可不是我的乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my idea of fun isn't risking death so that you can meet some cute mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森不只是帅，是性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan isn't cute. He's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说了，你也不能一辈子都那么循规蹈矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, you can't spend your whole life playing it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.82,0:04:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我会的 - 爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know I would. - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没必要生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason to be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我不喜欢你去瀑布那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I feel about you going to the falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.76,0:04:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是独自一人，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not alone, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不作数，小样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't count, Weiner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.20,0:04:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的没错，我就是这么微不足道，谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there's my place, and you just put me in it, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧，女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家了，这次我会看牢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going home where I can keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我是等在这，还是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, should I just wait here, or…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓不倒我的，大自然母亲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you don't scare me, Mother Nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何变故，我都能应付自如\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you can throw at me that I can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.74,0:05:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是！我刚把方向盘拧掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had better be! I just lost the steering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.21,0:05:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到珍珍吗？该给她喂饭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone seen Precious? Lt's her feeding time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈！奶奶又在叨叨她那只死掉的宠物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom! Granny's talking about her dead pet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,爪子甩起来，各位！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, paws up, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下来，叔叔，求你了！胳肢窝好臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paws down, Uncle, please! That is nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.53,0:05:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心点，米尔顿，你会伤着人的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, Milton, you're going to hurt somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏猫猫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有岩石！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，那到底什么时候，我才能出去和男孩子约会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so tell me, when exactly will I be allowed to hang out with boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,得等我咽气，之后三天，彻底死翘翘了才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm dead, plus three days. Just to make sure I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.47,0:06:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼，你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.78,0:06:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我脸上…滚下去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off… my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣，现在，我该先吃谁呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fun. Now, who should I eat first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.79,0:06:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,霉叔叔！真的是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Fungus! Could that really be you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.47,0:07:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,马歇尔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marshall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿！ - 奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个南瓜可以摘了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pumpkin's ripe for picking!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.34,0:07:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的一家子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My whole familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.21,0:07:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见没？他仍然会拥抱他的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? He still hugs his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没想过还能再见到我的小宝贝，我们到处找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought I'd see my little baby again. We've been searching everywhere for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.41,0:07:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们找过我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.55,0:07:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道！我就知道！我没被抛弃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it, I knew it! Deep down, I knew I wasn't abandoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对，我们是抛弃你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's incorrect. We totally abandoned you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.89,0:07:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还是想你的，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we always missed you. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对对对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也知道希德想见他可怜的亲奶奶…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we just knew Sid would want to see his poor, dear Granny…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.33,0:07:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}before her time is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会给你们送葬，在你们坟墓上起舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'll bury you all and dance on your graves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.57,0:07:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看她多憔悴\N{\fnArial\fs30}So frail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.67,0:07:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她老是吵着要你做伴呢，希德\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she can't wait to spend time with you, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，奶奶，奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, Granny? Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奶奶 - 从来就不让我玩个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Granny. - I never get to have any fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去看看你的洞穴，让她休息下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you show her your cave? Yeah, she could use a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.86,0:08:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，我有好多话要跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, there's so much to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从上次见到你之后，发生了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot has happened since the last time I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在冰川时代和恐龙搏斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we fought dinosaurs in the lce Age.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿虽然离奇，但挺激动人心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't make sense, but it sure was exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于摆脱这个疯老太婆了！快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got rid of the crazy bat! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！你们不能就这么走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa! You can't just leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德会崩溃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid will be crushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，亲爱的，老家山崩地裂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, cookie, things are breaking apart back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得搬去内陆，奶奶是个大累赘\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're headed inland. And Granny is just dead weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.62,0:08:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 快走，快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you. - Mush, mush!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们提个醒，她有点神志不清！\N{\fnArial\fs30}And warn the community. She tends to wander!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.32,0:08:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,得，怪不得希德也总是疯疯癫癫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains a lot about Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸，妈，奶奶的假牙在你们那儿吗？她找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, Dad, do you have Granny's teeth? She can't find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你能帮我嚼嚼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Can you chew this thing for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.64,0:08:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们？他们人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys? Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家人被一颗小行星砸没了，节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family was wiped out by an asteroid. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:08:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈要说的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What Diego is trying to say is…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来找你，只是想让你照顾奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only wanted to find you so you could take care of Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，什么样的变态家庭会随便抛弃自己的奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, what kind of sick family would ditch their Granny on someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.76,0:09:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太疯狂了，真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just crazy. That's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.30,0:09:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,太像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我的家人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码你还有奶奶，对吗，伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you still have Granny. Right, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.07,0:09:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，奶奶，奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Granny. Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.21,0:09:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,以她这把年纪，跑得可真够快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. For an old girl, she moves fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.48,0:09:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奶奶？ - 奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Granny? - Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.35,0:09:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.45,0:09:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来，别躲了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come out, come out wherever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来吧，奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.02,0:09:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶，我这有梅干噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Granny, Granny. I have prunes for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.59,0:09:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮你嚼好了噢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the way you like them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.47,0:10:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一被你爸发现怎么办？我外强中干的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if your dad finds out? I'm not as tough as I look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，你听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.49,0:10:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go long!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，瞧，那是伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, there's Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶，伊森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Ethan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真棒，帅哥！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.50,0:10:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没，有乐子，没危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Fun, no danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我肯定他没事 - 我绝对有事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sure he's fine. - I'm completely not fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧！太疯狂了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not just do that! That was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.99,0:10:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是很完美？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lsn't he perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,“完美”，说得过头了吧，也就“差不多”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Perfect". It's such a strong word. Maybe "adequate".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在跟踪谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are we stalking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.44,0:11:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是伊森吗？我猜是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ls it Ethan? I bet it's Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.97,0:11:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿，小样 - 你们在这干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Weiner. - What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.67,0:11:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼让我们盯紧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny told us to keep an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但不能让你发现 - 在任何情况之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But not to let you see us. - Under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢死了，蠢死了，蠢死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid, stupid, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我要上了，我看起来还行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm going for it. Do I look okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.42,0:11:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.92,0:11:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你岂止是“还行”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Okay" doesn't even begin to cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.56,0:11:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯，你是我最好的朋友！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis. You're the greatest friend ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.70,0:11:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.10,0:11:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森，你好，我是桃桃，你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Ethan, my name's Peaches. What's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.04,0:11:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是干嘛？随意点，就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I doing? Okay, just be cool, just be…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.78,0:11:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那招厉害！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,痛死我了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This hurts so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌，她就是那个和负鼠一样胆小的怪象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross. It's that weirdo who chills with possums!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！伊森，真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Ethan, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.41,0:12:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦，你近看更帅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you're even better-looking up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.81,0:12:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太帅了，我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phenomenal. I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有个双胞胎姐妹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a twin sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打扰到你们了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I interrupting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸！ - 糟糕，好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Oh, boy. Okay…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，让我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, if I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等下，不对，你往左边 - 往后一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, no, you go left. - Just move back a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.59,0:12:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你！离我女儿远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Keep away from my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸… - 还有你，你被禁足了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad… - And you, you're grounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我什么也没… - 禁足！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But I didn't do… - Grounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.29,0:12:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好衰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟，那就是她爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch, that's her dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的，太丢脸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, that's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.97,0:12:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃，别这样，我们聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches, come on. Let's talk about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.34,0:12:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能当着我朋友的面给我难堪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you embarrass me in front of my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你故意去你不该去的地方！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deliberately went where you weren't supposed to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.25,0:12:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能控制我的生活！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't control my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.98,0:12:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在保护你！这是父亲的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to protect you! That's what fathers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.25,0:13:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…我希望你不是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… I wish you weren't my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是心情不好，亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just upset, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.43,0:13:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃！这又不是世界末日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches! Lt's not the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.67,0:13:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢，不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这动静跟你没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事儿？ - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,待着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.29,0:13:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾丽！ - 曼尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ellie! - Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸！ - 桃桃！回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad! - Peaches, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，爸爸！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Dad! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迭戈！ - 你跳不过去的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Diego! - You never would have made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽，当心后面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.49,0:14:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,去陆桥那儿！你们过了桥就安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the land bridge! You'll be safe on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，曼尼！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Manny! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在那里见！\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'll meet you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.39,0:14:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽，你得离开这，快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, you have to get out of here! Go! Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:14:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈！ - 回来！回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mom! - Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.73,0:15:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.27,0:15:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好活着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管要多久，我都会找到你们的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how long it takes, I will find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.11,0:15:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈，这都是我的错，如果我听…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, this is all my fault. If I had just listened…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.62,0:15:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃！这不怪你，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches! This is not your fault, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我再也见不到他呢？ 而我们最后一次见面就是吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I never see him again? And the last thing we did was fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.59,0:15:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸是我见过最坚韧顽强的猛犸象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, your father is the toughest, most stubborn mammoth I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.23,0:15:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来找我们的，他保证过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come back for us. That's a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，帮我把它转向！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Help me turn this thing around!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家，冷静点，别慌张！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, please, settle down. Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.78,0:16:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，妈妈，路易斯呢？我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Mom, where's Louis? We have to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.53,0:16:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们需要我，我们得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need me! We got to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.40,0:16:35.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟，这家伙太大了，转不动 洋流正把我们往外推\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, this thing's too big to turn. The current's pulling us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.97,0:16:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈曾说过，塞翁失马，焉知非福\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my mother once told me that bad news was just good news in disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她抛弃你之前说的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was this before she abandoned you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.21,0:16:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但重点是，虽然一时狂风暴雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the point being that, even though things look bad…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但风雨过后就会有彩虹…\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a rainbow around every corner…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还会一帆风顺！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing but smooth sailing ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.43,0:16:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一帆风顺，希德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smooth sailing, Sid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.07,0:17:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路易斯？路易斯？ - 路易斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Louis? Louis? - Louis?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.40,0:17:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小样！小样！小样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weiner! Weiner! Weiner!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯，你在哪？快，我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis where are you? Come on, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.12,0:17:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯，你得跳下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis, you have to jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！你们快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Go, save yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会丢下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.43,0:17:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我宁愿走地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is why I travel underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.28,0:17:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你回来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢？不能抛弃朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? You don't leave a friend behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.12,0:17:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那堵墙会一直移动，压死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wall is going to keep moving and crush us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去陆桥那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get to the land bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.36,0:18:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.19,0:18:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们用象鼻吸水的时候，有没有鼻屎味？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you drink water through your trunk, does it taste like boogers?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃，有时候有啦，快走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sometimes. Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.15,0:18:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛一直盯着地平线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep your eye on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到地平线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.63,0:18:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大螃蟹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:18:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.05,0:19:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't make it…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.58,0:19:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我讨个老婆，告诉她我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}find me a wife, and tell her I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还活着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀，大海，你就这点能耐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, ocean, is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.67,0:19:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的对吗，兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I right, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,风雨过后真的有彩虹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there really is a rainbow around every corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.74,0:19:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.71,0:20:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.51,0:20:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是很担心我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just so worried about my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.45,0:20:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我们一定会找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we're going to get to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,照这速度，我们会一直赶在那堵墙前面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}At this pace, we'll stay ahead of the wall…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快我们就会到达陆桥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll make it to the land bridge before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.69,0:20:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all going to survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，也许他们不会，但其他人都会没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe they won't. But everyone else, totally fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们离家越来越远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still heading away from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.76,0:20:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，但我们活下来了，还有彼此相伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but we survived, and we still have each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情可能会更糟，不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things could be worse, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.27,0:21:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总算说对了一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once, he's actually right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们战胜了暴风巨浪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made it through storms and tidal waves…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.60,0:21:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,和各种凶恶的海鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a vicious assortment of seafood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还能出什么招？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more can they hit us with?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.98,0:21:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想起来的时候，非得叫我起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to make me get up if I don't want to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来的时候，自然就会起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I want to get up I'd get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.18,0:21:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.15,0:21:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.25,0:21:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的，我还要睡觉呢！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dagnabbit, I'm trying to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶？你还活着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny? You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你可真是太‘惊’喜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can we say how thrilled we are to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.59,0:21:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，胖子，不打算把我弄出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, fats, you want to get me out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装我是一块甜点，那样你就有动力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretend I'm a dessert, that should motivate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.90,0:21:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信，你就这么睡着，过了这场暴风雨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this. You slept through that storm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,彗星撞地球那次，我也照样睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I slept through the comet that killed the unicorns.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.61,0:21:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你给我放的洗澡水，希德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for drawing my bath, Sidney.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.61,0:21:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奶奶，抓住我的爪子 - 没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Granny, grab my paw. - No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是我几十年来头一次洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my first bath in decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.62,0:21:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's your proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！谁来帮帮忙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Somebody do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:22:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我抓住你了，奶奶 - 放开我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got you, Granny. - Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.63,0:22:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.33,0:22:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些混小子看什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you peeping toms all looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.80,0:22:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不能让我好好洗个澡？像盯烤肉一样盯着我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lady can't take a bath in peace? Eyeballing me like a rump roast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.47,0:22:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,母树獭平均寿命多长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the life expectancy for a female sloth?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定活得比我们久，对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll outlive us all, you know that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好人不长命，恶人活千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the spiteful ones live the longest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.98,0:24:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这片海洋到底有多大啊？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big is this ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.85,0:24:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是水水水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water, water, everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.99,0:24:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,却一滴都不能喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor any drop to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.63,0:24:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许除了这滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, except maybe that drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.53,0:24:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点…咸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a little… salty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.43,0:24:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍珍！妈妈叫你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious! Mommy's calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍珍！过来，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious! Come here, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.71,0:25:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，女士，你见到珍珍了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, lady, have you seen Precious?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.94,0:25:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说的是，你一直在找的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lf you mean the imaginary, or perhaps deceased, pet…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.45,0:25:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只想象的或已死的宠物，没，我没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you keep searching for, no, I haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.25,0:25:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙，快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.62,0:25:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有鸟的地方，就有岛屿，对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where there's birds, there's land, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.19,0:25:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟儿，飞过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.89,0:25:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等等！飞回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait! Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.26,0:25:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大块肥肉啊，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's a huge bounty, mon capitaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.78,0:25:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,四名乘客，引颈待宰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four passengers. Ripe for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.61,0:25:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个很臭，一个很胖\N{\fnArial\fs30}One very smelly, and one very plump.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.22,0:25:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的海域？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.32,0:25:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞大运了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a terrible turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.16,0:25:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就爱撞大运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a terrible turn of events.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.67,0:26:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我幻觉了，还是那块冰正向我们漂过来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I hallucinating, or is that ice coming straight towards us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.07,0:26:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，正漂过来，听起来上面有动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, it's coming. It sounds like there's animals on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.18,0:26:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒！我们得救了，得救了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yippee! We're being rescued, we're being rescued!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.71,0:26:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到了笑声\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.62,0:26:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是一艘派对游轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a party cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.08,0:26:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看起来毛茸茸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, they look fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.24,0:26:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要那个毛毛的大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get the big woolly one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.92,0:26:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.35,0:26:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好把他们大卸八块，伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get ready to slice and dice, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.79,0:26:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别吵，斜眼 - 嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Knock it off, Squint. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.46,0:26:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待船长指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for Captain's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，下面的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahoy, down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.53,0:27:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}How lucky are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.03,0:27:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一片海域常有海盗出没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know these waters are infested with pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.30,0:27:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧，孩儿们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有幸抢在他们之前找到你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad we found you before they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.64,0:27:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚黑船长来帮你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Gutt, here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.61,0:27:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那猴子可真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that's a nice monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.95,0:27:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，我们不想惹麻烦，我们只想回到大陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we don't want any trouble. We just need to get back to the continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.62,0:27:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大陆？那个大石子堆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The continent? That pile of rubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.69,0:27:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人在那，所以如果你能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family's there, so if you could just…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.56,0:27:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的家人？真是温馨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family? That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你跟她们告别过了，因为你已经回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you said goodbye, because there's no way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,回得去的，你不记得了吗，船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, there is. Don't you remember, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.81,0:27:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以驶去之型湾，然后顺着洋流回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can sail to Switchback Cove and catch the current back from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.35,0:27:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这小脑袋，记得很牢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a steel trap, this noggin is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.71,0:27:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,万分感谢，福林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mister Flynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.48,0:27:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧？我就知道能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? I knew there was a way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.69,0:28:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想回去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no home!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.83,0:28:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里，你的船归我所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here, your ship belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.03,0:28:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入战斗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Battle stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.10,0:28:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,扬起旗帜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly the colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.61,0:28:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是投降，还是领教我的暴怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now surrender your ship or face my fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.88,0:28:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,领教你的毛什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or face your furry what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.71,0:28:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是“毛什么”，是“暴怒”！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not "furry". Fury!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.25,0:28:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.12,0:28:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,打中猛犸赢大奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the mammoth, win a prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.72,0:28:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,叮叮叮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding, ding, ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.69,0:28:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射右舷炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire the starboard cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.29,0:28:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就爱干这个！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.60,0:28:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉，活捉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shira, fetch.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.87,0:28:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye-aye, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.94,0:28:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点就成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You almost made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.17,0:28:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不跟女人打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fight girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.31,0:28:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你太弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see why.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.28,0:29:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚皮跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belly flop.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.72,0:29:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳伦巴吧，小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's rumba, Tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.12,0:29:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡了，大家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights out, big fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.56,0:29:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.07,0:29:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.41,0:29:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.07,0:29:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎参加派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.41,0:29:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们瞧瞧你会跳什么舞，跳啊，小奎特鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what kind of moves you got. Dance, little Scrat fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.41,0:29:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽情跳吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dance your coconuts off!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢快地跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.13,0:29:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的战利品呢？有谁瞧见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my bootie? Has anyone seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.59,0:29:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,老兄，就在你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it's right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.36,0:29:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪，我的战利品在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where? Where's my bootie?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.47,0:29:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.10,0:29:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就看到了你的大屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.17,0:29:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我度过的最美好的休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a lovely vacation. Best I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.04,0:30:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好，阳光帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先伸出友谊之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me be the first to extend the hand of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.28,0:30:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.51,0:30:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都瞒不过你，是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing gets by you, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.48,0:30:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.82,0:30:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定你现在感到失落、害怕和迷惘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you're feeling lost, scared, confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.96,0:30:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.76,0:30:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,奏乐，孩儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me out, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.49,0:30:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长要唱小曲了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's going to sing a shanty!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.26,0:30:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一叶小舟，一路荡，一路漂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are on a boat You're adrift, you're afloat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.16,0:30:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们迷失在茫茫大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}One might even say you're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.97,0:30:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有幸灾乐祸，我是要善意提醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't want to gloat But I would like to note.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.30,0:30:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you're in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.74,0:30:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,海上霸王大猩猩拯救了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been saved by the ape That rules these waters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.31,0:30:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别再想你的妻女了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So forget about Your wives and daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.31,0:30:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大副，请向他们细数我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}First Mate introduce me to them, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.81,0:30:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到，肚黑船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye-aye, Captain Gutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.81,0:30:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他庞大又恐怖 - 高雅却多毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's the big and scary - Elegant yet hairy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.95,0:30:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 望而生畏 - 面皮发黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fear-inspiring - Years from retiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.05,0:30:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 打劫偷盗 - 剥皮香蕉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Looting, stealing - Banana peeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.15,0:30:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当之无愧，海上霸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undisputed Master of the Seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.72,0:30:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.79,0:30:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是我 - 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's me - 'Tis he.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.86,0:30:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是我 - 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's me - 'Tis he.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.93,0:30:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是我 - 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's me - 'Tis he.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.99,0:30:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.73,0:30:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是灵长类海盗先驱，这些是我的敢死喽啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a primate pirate pioneer And these are my brave buccaneers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.03,0:31:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也曾像你们一样，迷失了灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of whom were once Lost souls like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.74,0:31:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.87,0:31:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他拯救了我们 - 他救了我们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He rescued us - He saved our butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.91,0:31:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们都欠他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}For that we owe our lives to Gutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.87,0:31:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他饶你们不死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And assuming he doesn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.11,0:31:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也欠他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will owe him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.51,0:31:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.05,0:31:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吗？不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.25,0:31:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码不杀这头有用的大块头猛犸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least not this very large, useful mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.69,0:31:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hands off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.25,0:31:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.62,0:31:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同乘一条船，全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are on a ship Moving at quite a clip.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.76,0:31:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起穿梭于冰河之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through the ever-shifting ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一道航行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.66,0:31:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 暗示你哦 - 提示你哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a hint - That's a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.76,0:31:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好的建议哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.70,0:31:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这下沉的世界，要活命就得学会抢劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a world that's going under To survive you must learn to plunder.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.77,0:31:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正好是我的专长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily that's my field of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.00,0:31:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.14,0:31:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他抢劫偷盗 - 我们真的该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a robbing, thieving - We really should be leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.41,0:31:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舞刀弄枪 - 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Weapon throwing - We got to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.38,0:31:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 屠杀树獭 - 希望我们能留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sloth-slaying - Wish we could be staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.54,0:31:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当之无愧，毫无争议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undisputed Uncontested.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.38,0:31:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这猴子就是 - 对，说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Monkey suited - Yeah, you guessed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.55,0:31:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,海上霸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master of the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.05,0:31:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.15,0:31:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是我 - 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's me - 'Tis he.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.22,0:31:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是我 - 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's me - 'Tis he.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.29,0:31:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是谁？ - 是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's who? - It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.36,0:31:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,考考你们而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just testing, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.46,0:31:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.79,0:32:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,唱的真好，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shanty, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.56,0:32:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,“肚黑船长”？是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Captain Gutt"? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.26,0:32:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有点小肚子，但我不会拿这个当名字使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a little paunch, too, but I wouldn't name myself after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.67,0:32:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很搞笑，你真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny. You're a funny guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.07,0:32:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那不是我名字的由来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's not how I got my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.31,0:32:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是靠这个来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These got me my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.44,0:32:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没懂 - 不懂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't get it. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.28,0:32:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.75,0:32:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你演示一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me give you a visual aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.35,0:32:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我轻轻的按住这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just gently press here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.75,0:32:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好痒 - 然后往下一划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That tickles. - And go down like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.79,0:32:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你的内脏就全出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then your innards become your outards.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.99,0:32:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是没懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.26,0:32:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，就算我想加入，可一只猴子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, as much as I'm tempted to join a monkey…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.86,0:32:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只复活节兔子，还有一大包布丁…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Easter Bunny and a giant bag of pudding…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.87,0:32:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还是算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.24,0:32:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能阻止我回到家人身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one's going to stop me from getting back to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.41,0:32:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我不把你的心肝挖出来，小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to lambada with your liver, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.74,0:32:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拦着我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.48,0:32:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,要见家人，死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}That family is going to be the death of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.05,0:32:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大副，把累赘扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}First mate, jettison the deadweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.85,0:33:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，船长，准备跳板！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye-aye, sir. Prepare the plank!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.76,0:33:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备跳板！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the plank!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.36,0:33:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备跳板！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Preparing the plank!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.66,0:33:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么，你想我走进水里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You want me to walk into the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.53,0:33:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行，我刚吃了东西 按规矩你们不能处死一个刚吃饱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't because I just ate less than 20 minutes ago, and you know the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.43,0:33:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.83,0:33:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，只要安全就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, as long as it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.71,0:33:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等！ - 谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! - Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.78,0:33:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人也扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dump the wench, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.74,0:33:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士优先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies first.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.71,0:33:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真懂事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a nice boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.78,0:33:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么就不学着点，希德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you be more like him, Sidney?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.52,0:33:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶，别！等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny, no! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.69,0:33:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.42,0:33:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我弄到树藤那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me to the vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.96,0:33:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.63,0:33:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们养的金鱼好丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all got some ugly goldfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.77,0:33:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，再过去点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.74,0:33:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.75,0:34:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭了那只猛犸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extinct that mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油，曼尼，狠狠踢他的猴屁股！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Manny, kick his monkey butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.65,0:34:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.15,0:34:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,11吨的旱鸭子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eleven tons of landlubber blubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.19,0:34:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是胖，是蓬松！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm not fat! I'm poufy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.16,0:34:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜了，肥仔，本来我还想提拔你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad, Tubby. I could have used you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.26,0:34:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做梦了，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't going to happen, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.31,0:34:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接住你了，奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.11,0:34:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快，我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giddy up, let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.32,0:34:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有救生圈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have floaties?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.52,0:34:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.62,0:34:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的战利品！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.87,0:35:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们弄沉了我们的战舰，我们怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sunk our battleship. What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.68,0:35:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会被淹死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all going to drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.01,0:35:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是海洋生物，白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a sea creature, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.62,0:35:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得对，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good point, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.92,0:35:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我举白旗吗，船长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I fly the white, captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.12,0:35:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.45,0:35:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，希拉哪儿去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what about Shira?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.46,0:35:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她能上哪儿去？ - 就是，她又能上哪儿去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about her? - Yeah, what about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.63,0:35:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁想来充“船长”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else want to play "Captain"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.03,0:35:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，白痴，给我游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come on, blubber-brain. Swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.30,0:35:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂！肚黑船长！福林！在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Gutt! Flynn! Anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.84,0:35:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里，抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, grab hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.71,0:35:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开，我宁愿淹死\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, go away. I'd rather drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.44,0:35:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the lady wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.88,0:35:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了不用你帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I didn't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.95,0:35:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气，愿意屈尊加入我们这支老弱残兵吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome. So, care to join our scurvy crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.59,0:35:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,两只树獭，一只猛犸和一只剑齿虎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two sloths, a mammoth and a saber?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.73,0:35:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这支队伍就是一个大笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are like the start of a bad joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.89,0:35:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可就是我们救的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.66,0:35:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才是笑点，猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes you the punch line, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.73,0:36:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许叫我“猫咪”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me "kitty."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.63,0:36:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我不叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I won't…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.90,0:36:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.00,0:36:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要是接吻，我可要吐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they kiss, I'm going to puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.77,0:36:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？哦不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Wait, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.19,0:36:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.13,0:36:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们永远也到不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think we're ever going to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.17,0:36:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许该休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we should rest for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.94,0:36:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.88,0:36:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安，艾丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.22,0:36:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.65,0:36:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的奇景可真是难得一见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's something you don't see every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.39,0:36:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.49,0:36:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.53,0:37:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我故意这样下树的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.50,0:37:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过猛犸倒挂着睡觉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen a mammoth sleep like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.57,0:37:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥？我才不是在睡觉，倒挂有助我思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No, this just helps me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.64,0:37:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,促进大脑血液循环…什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets blood to the old noggin and away from the old… whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.64,0:37:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，还是有点怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's a little weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.05,0:37:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗，发生了这么多事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how are you doing, you know, with all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.89,0:37:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话，有点害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，是很怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, a lot scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.13,0:37:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们熟悉的东西都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we knew is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.73,0:37:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，我也很怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was pretty scared, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.56,0:37:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是怕，是担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not scared, but, like, concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.07,0:37:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明天想和我一块走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to walk with me tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.67,0:37:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起忘掉这些烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and get our minds off all this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.44,0:37:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意和我一起走？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to walk with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.34,0:37:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上你差点把我压扁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did almost flatten me this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.44,0:37:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想，应该不会发生比这更糟糕的事了，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I figure it can't really go worse than that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.55,0:37:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.65,0:37:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.75,0:37:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没什么大不了，但你最好别带上那只鼹鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's totally no big deal, but you might want to lose the molehog.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.28,0:38:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯吗？好的，没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis? Yeah, sure, not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.79,0:38:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.09,0:38:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人很开心哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone looks happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.56,0:38:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森很棒，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan's great, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.23,0:38:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝，我知道你喜欢他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, I know you like this one…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.60,0:38:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别为了别人改变自己，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but just don't let anyone change who you are, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.54,0:38:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.78,0:38:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.55,0:38:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚就睡下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm going to sleep down here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.32,0:38:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.12,0:38:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.79,0:38:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Night, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.72,0:38:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.00,0:38:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我嚼嚼这个三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, chew this sandwich for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.31,0:38:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶，为什么家里人要抛弃我们，我们有错吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny, why didn't our family want us? What's wrong with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.78,0:39:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们觉得我们一团糟，什么都做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think we're screw-ups and we can't do anything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.68,0:39:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有老鼠！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.49,0:39:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.36,0:39:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又搞砸了 - 希德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Screw up. - Oh, Sid!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.50,0:39:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠这个我们回不了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never make it home on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.96,0:39:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你弄翻我们的船之前，就该想到了，天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should have thought of that before you capsized our berg, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.40,0:39:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.67,0:39:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 窝囊废！ - 唠叨鬼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wimp! - Whiner!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.77,0:39:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱哭鬼！ - 陆地！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crybaby! - Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.87,0:39:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，陆地！等等，啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, land! Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.51,0:39:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说她，看那！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not her. There!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.68,0:39:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆地！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.05,0:39:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快划！快划！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone paddle. Paddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.37,0:40:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物！想死你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food! I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.18,0:40:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我，都饿扁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, I've wasted away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.72,0:40:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，点心吃够了，我们得造个木筏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, snack time is over. We got to build a raft.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.59,0:40:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.69,0:40:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉肯定很讨厌造木筏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, Shira must really hate building rafts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.16,0:40:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,追上她，没她指路我们回不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get her. She can help us get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.96,0:40:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shira!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.25,0:40:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,逮到你了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.02,0:40:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.83,0:40:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.93,0:40:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跑哪去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.93,0:41:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.80,0:41:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,之型湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switchback Cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.94,0:41:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.44,0:41:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.67,0:41:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管这叫船？可悲的畜生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call this a ship you miserable runts?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.91,0:41:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些小畜生，快干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you little runts. Get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.91,0:41:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，你们这些没用的，连喂鲨鱼的象鼻虫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, you worthless, wormy sons of sorry excuses…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.58,0:41:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,都抱歉的小臭屁虫！\N{\fnArial\fs30}for shark bait weevils!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.25,0:41:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说的啥？ - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did he say? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.12,0:41:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落之前把这艘冰船造好…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get this chunk of ice seaworthy by sundown…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.26,0:41:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则把你们杀光！\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will keelhaul the lot of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.43,0:41:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.80,0:41:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,四个字，愤怒管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two words, anger management.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.87,0:41:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说洋流\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.70,0:41:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈说的对，我们找到回家的路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego's right. We found the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.74,0:41:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了，可惜我们没有船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's great. Too bad we don't have a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.11,0:41:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有，就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure we do. It's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.71,0:41:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划可真完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's a flawless plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.28,0:41:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算从一群海盗手里打劫一艘海盗船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to pirate a pirate ship from pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.49,0:41:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我很不想这么说，但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It pains me to say this, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.15,0:41:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们的人质说的没错 - 这个嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- our prisoner has a point. - Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.99,0:41:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们，那些树都有耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. The trees have ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.98,0:42:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，也许我们能互相帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, maybe we can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.81,0:42:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙，出来下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, little fellas. Hey, come on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.98,0:42:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不，没关系的，我们不会伤害你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's okay. We're not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.92,0:42:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们联合起来对抗海盗，怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you and us against the pirates, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.73,0:42:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道我在说什么，对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no idea what I'm saying, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.63,0:42:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，船，我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, ship, me want.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.30,0:42:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当你是丛林英雄啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, nice try Jungle Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.40,0:42:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管嘲笑我吧，他懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead make fun. He got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.84,0:42:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.34,0:42:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来试试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I try?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.58,0:42:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.91,0:42:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.69,0:43:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,八百标兵奔北坡，八百标兵奔北坡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick sloths sip broth, sick sloths sip broth.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.87,0:43:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.61,0:43:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都能懂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, they got?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.02,0:43:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，他们同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, they're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.36,0:43:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，我们会救出你们的朋友，同心协力…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, we'll free your buddies and we can all work together…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.09,0:43:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,再抢些战利品\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kick a little pirate booty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.78,0:44:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张，猫咪，给你水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, kitty. Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.32,0:44:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.52,0:44:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用你可怜我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need anything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.15,0:44:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，渴死吧，这样你就能倔强到底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, die of thirst. That will really show me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.92,0:44:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.39,0:44:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.19,0:44:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.56,0:44:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这句“谢谢”的语气，倒像是在说“去死”\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a way of saying "thank you" that makes it sound like "drop dead."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.40,0:44:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我天赋异禀呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.23,0:44:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为剑齿虎，你太温柔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're pretty soft, for a saber.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.64,0:44:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思，我那不是温柔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, I am not soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.71,0:44:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是杀人不眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I happen to be a remorseless assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.67,0:44:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈亲爱的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego-poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.41,0:44:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又给你做了个珊瑚项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I made you another coral necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.34,0:44:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是弄丢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He keeps losing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.15,0:44:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我开始理解为什么你不跟随虎群了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think I'm starting to get why you're not in a pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.99,0:44:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着，我主动离开他们的，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I chose to leave my pack, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.22,0:44:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜啊，公主战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, warrior princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.66,0:44:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.02,0:44:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 咋了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.66,0:44:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么，我能理解离开熟悉的一切…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, I just know how hard that is…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.43,0:44:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}walking away from everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.36,0:44:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢，太棒了，我们这是要促膝谈心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great, are we going to braid each other's fur now?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.40,0:44:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈，真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny. Really funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.27,0:44:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我告诉你我之间的区别吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I tell you the difference between you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.00,0:44:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我就不会戴那条项链？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't still be wearing that necklace?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.01,0:45:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，也许我们都离开了虎群\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we both might have wanted out of pack life…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.71,0:45:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我并非单纯从一个群落改换到另一个群落\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least I didn't trade one pack for another.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.21,0:45:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得到的更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.85,0:45:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗，那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.12,0:45:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个团队 - 有什么区别？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A herd. - What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.25,0:45:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们互相照应\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have each other's backs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.62,0:45:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚黑船长也照应我，我是他的大副\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gutt has my back. I'm his first mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.22,0:45:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我可没瞧见肚黑船长派人来搜寻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Because I don't see Gutt sending out any search parties for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.39,0:45:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打不赢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you won't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.43,0:45:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个毛绒绒的大块头朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your big furry friend over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.77,0:45:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道自己面对的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has no idea what he's up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.57,0:45:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，但肚黑船长也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but neither does Gutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.10,0:45:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,解开绳索，直到我们都上船了再松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unwind the binds, don't let go until we're all on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.64,0:45:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，我们需要每个人都准时完成任务，才能抢到船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we need precision timing from everyone to get that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.71,0:45:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,半品脱，你都准备好了，对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half-pint, you got your end covered, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.05,0:45:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当你点头了，迭戈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to take that as a "yes." Diego?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.05,0:45:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救出他的那些小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'll free his little friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.52,0:45:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德和奶奶？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid and Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.72,0:45:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,松绑船只，长官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untie the ship, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.46,0:45:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，解开藤索，直到我们都上船了再松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, unwind the vines, and don't let go until we're all on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.09,0:45:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都靠你了，希德，明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're relying on you, Sid. You got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.13,0:45:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，全力以赴，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir. Totally focused, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.00,0:45:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.13,0:46:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然我们不用再看守希拉，事情简单很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be easy since we don't have to guard Shira anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.84,0:46:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得行动了，马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to move, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.57,0:46:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,斜眼，封舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squint, batten down the hatches.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.68,0:46:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉兹，起锚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raz, hoist the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.48,0:46:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,古普塔，扬起旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Gupta, fly the colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.71,0:46:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.48,0:46:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们起航复仇去，孩儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're setting sail for vengeance, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.95,0:46:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.25,0:46:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.36,0:46:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉！噢，见到你我就放心了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shira! Oh, what a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.79,0:46:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd lost you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.29,0:46:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那头猛犸，他和我一起被冲到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mammoth. He washed ashore with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.43,0:46:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？他在这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? He's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.10,0:46:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有咬住他，他有求饶吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you sink your fangs into him? Did he beg for his life?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.80,0:46:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没，剑齿虎抓住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the saber took me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.87,0:46:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个败寇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.91,0:46:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要战士，手底下却尽是些猫咪和兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need warriors, and all I have are kitty cats and bunny rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及海豹和袋鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a seal and a kangaroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.78,0:46:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把剑齿虎干倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the saber down, or you die trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.95,0:46:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不成功，则成仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.06,0:46:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.79,0:47:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,斜眼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Squint.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.89,0:47:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.09,0:47:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是大副了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're first mate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.63,0:47:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就看我的吧，船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo-ho-ho and a bottle of cool with me, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.33,0:47:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挡道，剑齿虎，你现在得听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way, saber. You answer to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.20,0:47:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚黑船长，听着，他要来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gutt, listen, he's coming for the…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.94,0:47:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起武器，伙计们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your weapons, mates!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.75,0:47:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是勺子，福林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the spoon, Flynn.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.05,0:47:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.22,0:48:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.96,0:48:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me at him! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.93,0:48:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙们，没必要这样，真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, that's not necessary, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.90,0:48:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, too, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.80,0:48:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,去船上，别搞砸，去船上，别搞砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the ship, don't screw up. Get to the ship, don't screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.24,0:48:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 松绳索 - 别放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unwind the vines. - Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.47,0:48:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 松绳索 - 别放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unwind the vines. - Don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.44,0:48:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,松绳索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unwind the vines.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.58,0:48:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放…有果子！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let… Oh, yummo!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.42,0:48:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德，别吃！那是忘忧果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid, no! Lt's a lotus berry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.08,0:48:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你全身麻痹的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will paralyze you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.45,0:48:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托，我很了解莓果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. I know my berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.39,0:48:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.49,0:48:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,吞下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}swallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.59,0:48:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，我没事，我最了解的，莫过于莓果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm fine. If there's one thing I know, it's berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.86,0:48:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.96,0:49:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧我的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.93,0:49:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想尝尝复活节兔子的厉害？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's the Easter Bunny now?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.84,0:49:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了，他中计了！ - 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It worked, he bought it! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.84,0:49:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.21,0:49:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在声东击西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt's been a diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.55,0:49:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，我快要爆炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I'm having a blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.65,0:49:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，尖脑袋，他们是要偷我的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, pinhead, they're stealing my ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.39,0:49:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件事，希德，你就不能做好一件事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing, Sid. You couldn't do one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.39,0:49:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.26,0:49:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德，你听得到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.36,0:49:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.46,0:49:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,说话啊，朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.33,0:49:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.13,0:49:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.87,0:49:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.01,0:50:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，得在它入海之前赶上！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we've got to catch it before it hits open water!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.88,0:50:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，我把你举高点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. All right, l'll hold you higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.82,0:50:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.22,0:50:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,说再见吧，猛犸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say adieu, mammoth!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.06,0:50:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adieu!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.12,0:50:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉，朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.53,0:50:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了，希德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.08,0:50:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接住你了！接住了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you! I got you! I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.92,0:50:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来找你了，猛犸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming for you, mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.40,0:51:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.90,0:51:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.44,0:51:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，跑起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.52,0:51:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么这么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.65,0:51:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白，我没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.49,0:51:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必过这样的生活，希拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to live this way, Shira.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.23,0:51:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我们在一起会很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be safe with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.66,0:51:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们互相照应 - 迭戈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We take care of each other. - Diego!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.03,0:51:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快撑不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hold on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.77,0:51:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.93,0:51:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我们一起走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.47,0:51:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.15,0:51:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.28,0:51:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,照应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.61,0:52:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了，香蕉崽！谢谢你的船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, banana breath. Thanks for the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.84,0:52:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他永远离开我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, he's gone forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.37,0:52:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.78,0:53:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,上岸假结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shore leave is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.85,0:53:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这帮懒骨头都给我上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your sorry carcasses on board now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.63,0:53:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚黑船长，我能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gutt, I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.80,0:53:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一切结束了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this ends…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.07,0:53:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在墙上挂一张虎皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'll have a tiger's skin hanging on my wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.54,0:53:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管挂谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care whose.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.11,0:53:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只猛犸抢了我的船…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That mammoth has taken my ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.55,0:53:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的战利品…\N{\fnArial\fs30}my bounty…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.95,0:53:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还窃取了我手下的忠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the loyalty of my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.95,0:53:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要灭了他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will destroy him…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.02,0:53:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他所爱之物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everything he loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.94,0:54:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来了，快来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for it. Wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.95,0:54:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.19,0:54:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能问你们个事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you guys something?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.62,0:54:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩怎么这么高兴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you both so happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.62,0:54:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界就快末日了，你们不担心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't it weigh on you that the world might be ending?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.92,0:54:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能告诉他我们的秘诀吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I tell him our secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.03,0:54:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.63,0:54:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们非常，非常缺心眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're very, very stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.47,0:55:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道你们真没有一丁点的担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, still, you're not a teensy bit concerned about…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.94,0:55:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么讲呢，比如说迫在眉睫的死亡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, say, imminent death?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.28,0:55:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.48,0:55:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找桃桃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go find Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.12,0:55:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙，这边，快，有捷径\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, over here. Come on, it's a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.49,0:55:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.99,0:55:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀，姑娘们，一起来找点乐子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls, let's have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.39,0:55:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.66,0:55:25.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太酷了 - 就像翻了个倒栽葱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is so cool. - It's like we're upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.56,0:55:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惊人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.93,0:55:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶嘿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Echo!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.51,0:55:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那鼹鼠朋友不在真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad your molehog friend isn't here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.41,0:55:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不是真的朋友吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not really friends with him, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.04,0:55:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，说清楚，桃桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come clean, Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.98,0:55:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底和那只奇怪的鼹鼠是不是朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you friends with that awkward little rodent or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.78,0:55:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.88,0:55:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和路易斯是一起玩过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis and I, we've hung out or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.99,0:55:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们并不是真正的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, no, we're not really friends-friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.26,0:55:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.83,0:55:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯！我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis! I…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.03,0:55:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,被发现了哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.50,0:56:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.30,0:56:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯，等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.17,0:56:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑走的样子也很失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}He even runs away like a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.94,0:56:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃，别担心，你现在有我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, Peaches, don't stress. You're with us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.71,0:56:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心太有压力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, stress is so stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.38,0:56:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，妹子，要担心就担心你的发型吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, girl, if you're going to stress about something, stress about your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.05,0:56:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛？我的头发就受不了这里的湿度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right? This humidity, I can't stand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.29,0:56:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙，我们该离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.49,0:56:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧？这太赞了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? This is epic!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.36,0:56:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.17,0:56:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.84,0:56:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,多刺激啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How sick was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.41,0:56:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, that was insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.48,0:56:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃，放轻松，好好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Peach, loosen up! Have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.41,0:56:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩，那叫好玩？我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun, you call that fun? I'm out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.65,0:56:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样，你真的想回去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, do you really want to go back…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.05,0:56:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们抛下，和你那个怪鼹鼠朋友玩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hanging with a weird molehog freak and give all of this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.06,0:57:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说，你有一半负鼠血统就很糟糕了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's bad enough that your family is half possum and…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.39,0:57:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.66,0:57:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家人才不糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nothing bad about being part of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.00,0:57:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢倒吊着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like hanging by my tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.57,0:57:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们这些天才叫正常，这个物种很快就得灭绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you geniuses are normal, this species is going to end up extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.20,0:57:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的物种才会先灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, your species is going to be extinct first.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.57,0:57:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,切 ！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.21,0:57:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是同一物种，天才们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the same species, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.38,0:57:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我再切\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Double burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.77,0:57:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脚趾头又能动弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I can wiggle my toe again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.97,0:57:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重要的那个，去买菜都是它引的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The important one, the little piggy who went to market.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.44,0:57:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！我又能说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I'm talking again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.64,0:57:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有那么多话要说，却说不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had so many things trapped inside of me that I couldn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.78,0:57:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如‘嘿，我还活着！’\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, "Hey, I'm not dead!"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.58,0:57:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有‘为什么飓风有眼却没有耳朵？’\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, "Why does a hurricane have an eye but not an ear?"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.98,0:58:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他扔下船，你们就当是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}L'll push him overboard. You guys say it was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.92,0:58:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没意见，迭戈，你呢？迭戈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in. How about you, Diego? Diego?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.29,0:58:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松，朋友！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, relax, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.16,0:58:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子船长和他的漂流宠物园已经成历史了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Crazy and his floating petting zoo are history.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.26,0:58:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点！我们终于能回家了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! We're finally heading home!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.20,0:58:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道自己怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.40,0:58:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃不下睡不着，也许我是生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't eat, can't sleep. Maybe I'm coming down with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.17,0:58:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道是什么病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.14,0:58:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还病得不轻哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The L word.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.64,0:58:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻风病？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, leprosy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.48,0:58:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，希德，三个字对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sid, it's four letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.45,0:58:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是皮肤病，是心病\N{\fnArial\fs30}It starts with "L, " ends with "E."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.78,0:58:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,心绞痛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lice!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是，迭戈是得了相思病\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Diego, my friend, is in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.42,0:58:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此，他爱上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! Love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.42,0:58:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我爱上了那个海盗？才不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean with the pirate? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.63,0:58:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉让你寝食难安，承认吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shira's gotten under your skin. Come on, admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.93,0:58:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,死心眼的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rugged saber like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.20,0:58:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和更死心眼的她\N{\fnArial\fs30}A more rugged saber like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.94,0:58:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不，你们大错特错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. You guys are dead wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.94,0:58:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,否认就是掩饰，你恋爱了，猫咪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Denial is the clincher. You're in love, pussy cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.54,0:59:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈和希拉，坐在树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego and Shira Sitting in a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.18,0:59:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲-亲-亲-亲-亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}K-l-S-S-l-N-G.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.62,0:59:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,成熟点，伙计们，成熟点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real mature, guys. Real mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.85,0:59:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚生个虎宝宝，轻轻放在摇篮里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then comes marriage Then comes a baby in the baby carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.89,0:59:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸吸小手指…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucking his thumb…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.99,0:59:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.30,0:59:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迭戈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.70,0:59:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shira?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.47,0:59:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.54,0:59:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.54,0:59:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.21,0:59:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢邋里邋遢的树獭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I adore a sloth who cares nothing about personal hygiene.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.48,0:59:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我啦，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.15,0:59:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.72,0:59:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,来我这，奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.56,0:59:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.69,0:59:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,葡萄干越皱越甜，你越老越俏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wrinklier the raisin, the sweeter the fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.10,0:59:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny likey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.77,0:59:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny likey very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.37,1:00:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大伙，你们注意到了没有？ - 曼尼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, aren't you paying attention? - Manny…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.11,1:00:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼尼，你在吗？ - 艾丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manny, are you there? - Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.44,1:00:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这，曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're over here, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.41,1:00:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.05,1:00:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.55,1:00:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，宝贝，待在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, honey. Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.89,1:00:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.99,1:00:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的，曼尼，你一直是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right, Manny. You're always right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.36,1:00:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，听着，我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, look, I was…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.06,1:00:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，艾丽从来不会对我说这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Ellie would never say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.80,1:00:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼？曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny? Manny.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.63,1:00:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他们不是真的，他们是怪物！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're not real. They're monsters!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.27,1:00:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是海妖，别听他们的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're sirens. Don't listen to them!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.40,1:00:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能将太阳升起，洒满晨露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who can take the sunrise Sprinkle it with dew.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.78,1:00:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！她们看起来像真的，可她们不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! They may look real, but they're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.98,1:00:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们想把船撞毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're going to destroy the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.38,1:00:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊，老虎，和我一起遨游\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, tiger. Swim with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.09,1:00:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.76,1:00:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点心给你吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a snack for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.43,1:00:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也会做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she cooks, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.70,1:00:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德，别！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.85,1:01:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么在接吻？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we kissing?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.58,1:01:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许游艇出游就该浪漫点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because cruises are romantic?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.49,1:01:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟上个五秒，我们就都死翘翘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five more seconds and we'd have been goners.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.52,1:01:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,常联系哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.19,1:02:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,给，宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.73,1:02:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,给，珍珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Precious.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.83,1:02:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以为她终于找到宠物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks she finally found her pet.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.84,1:02:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好孩子，给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.34,1:02:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶，你就不能用幻想的食物喂你那幻想的宠物吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny, can't you throw imaginary food to your imaginary pet?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.41,1:02:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.48,1:02:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要随时了望家的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to keep a lookout for home.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.35,1:02:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理他们，珍珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignore them, Precious.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.45,1:03:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.03,1:03:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟不看着她都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't take your eyes off her for one minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.73,1:03:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，就跟带小孩一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, it's like having a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.27,1:03:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是没有任何乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only without any of the joy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.90,1:03:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，夸夸其谈的家伙们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, brain trust…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.44,1:03:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎接撞击吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}brace for impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.98,1:03:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, look.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.58,1:03:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到家了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost home!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.78,1:03:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伙计，我从没怀疑过你 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Buddy, I never doubted you. - Me either.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.32,1:03:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了有那么几次，我以为我们要完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for the six or seven times I thought we were going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.07,1:03:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了，甜心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, sweetheart?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.47,1:03:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有说过让自己追悔莫及的话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever say something you knew you couldn't take back?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.97,1:03:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,和路易斯有关？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ls this about Louis?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.44,1:03:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我彻底搞砸了，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I messed up so bad, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.24,1:04:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，难免的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.31,1:04:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无疑问，帅哥使人疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute boys can whiplash your brain. No doubt about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.18,1:04:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但伊森和我不合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Ethan was the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.12,1:04:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.72,1:04:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会知道该对路易斯说什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll know what to say to Louis.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.46,1:04:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.77,1:04:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,陆桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The land bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.24,1:04:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,塌掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.97,1:04:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.75,1:04:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们说好了在这里等爸爸，怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were supposed to meet Dad here. What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.33,1:04:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.50,1:04:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.47,1:04:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，陆桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. The land bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.67,1:05:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果陆桥塌了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it's gone…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.21,1:05:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么… - 希德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- how are we going to… - Sid!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.34,1:05:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，他们肯定在另外一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they have to be on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.48,1:05:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼，没有另外一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, there is no other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.68,1:05:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.81,1:05:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.38,1:05:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.52,1:05:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.82,1:05:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.52,1:05:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's got to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.70,1:05:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.97,1:05:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等，你听到吗？ - 曼尼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, did you hear that? - Manny…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.57,1:05:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我听到了，我听到了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I heard something. I heard it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.14,1:05:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是？ - 桃桃！是她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that? - Peaches? There she is!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.71,1:05:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.81,1:05:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了，宝贝，别动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming, sweetie. Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.28,1:05:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.38,1:05:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.68,1:05:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.52,1:05:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.29,1:05:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真巧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.82,1:05:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正谈论你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.63,1:05:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢这艘新船吗？我管她叫甜蜜复仇号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like the new ship? I call her Sweet Revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.30,1:06:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这，她们两个都落在我们手上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look here. We've got the catch du jour.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.44,1:06:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.64,1:06:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.44,1:06:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let my daughter go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.67,1:06:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.88,1:06:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要的是我，就让他来抓我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants me. And he's going to get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.68,1:06:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲自己救女儿，多么感人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrificing yourself for your daughter. How touching.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.75,1:06:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么老套啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How predictable.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.56,1:06:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来换她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now come and get her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.20,1:06:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,日安，朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, mate.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.30,1:06:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember us?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.67,1:06:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.24,1:06:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了，放了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let them go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.74,1:06:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.37,1:06:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁了我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You destroyed everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.11,1:06:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以牙还牙而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just returning the favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.68,1:06:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.18,1:06:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我警告过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I warned you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.25,1:06:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.09,1:06:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了猛犸象！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the mammoth go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.12,1:07:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,小样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weiner?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.09,1:07:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁请来的肌肉男？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who brought the muscle to the party?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.70,1:07:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯，别逞强！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis, don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.10,1:07:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干嘛？他这是找死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he doing? He's going to get himself killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.53,1:07:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系，我能搞定他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, I can handle him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.54,1:07:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,多温馨啊，英雄救美\N{\fnArial\fs30}How cute, a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.64,1:07:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就看看你有多勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what bravery gets you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.21,1:07:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,古普塔，把你的武器给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gupta, give the lad your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.61,1:07:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你，小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice knowing you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.49,1:07:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮招吧，英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's dance, hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.58,1:07:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别傻站着，抓住他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stand there like barnacles. Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.82,1:08:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去哪吗，朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oi, going somewhere, mate?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.62,1:08:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.73,1:08:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有遗言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any last words?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.93,1:08:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍珍！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.93,1:08:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能别再叫“珍珍”了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop with the "Precious"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.47,1:08:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.11,1:08:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们把他们吓跑了，对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess we showed them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.81,1:08:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 珍珍！ - 那是你的宠物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Precious! - That's your pet?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.99,1:08:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许奶奶也不是真的那么疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that crazy old bat isn't that crazy after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.22,1:08:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，她就是疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, she's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.59,1:08:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要我请你吗，小子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waiting for a formal invitation, fancy pants?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.16,1:08:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.30,1:08:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会后悔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to regret this.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.50,1:08:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bombs away!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.24,1:09:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别像个胆小猫一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a scaredy cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.05,1:09:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比我还难闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This smells worse than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.79,1:09:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍珍，向北45度前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precious, set your flippers 45 degrees north.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.29,1:09:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶不想再跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny's done running.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.03,1:09:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.13,1:09:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的，我跟你们一边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.93,1:09:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你是叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you were a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.47,1:09:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生气的时候，鼻子扭扭最可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your little bunny nose wiggles in the cutest way when you're mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.17,1:09:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.77,1:09:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳你的九条命来，猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your nine lives are over, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.71,1:09:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢兔子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silly rabbit…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.91,1:09:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,海盗没好下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}piracy doesn't pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.54,1:09:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真没意思，别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's not cool. Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.92,1:09:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁有沐浴露吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone have a body wipe?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.05,1:09:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,省省吧你，情况怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck it up, buttercup. How's it looking?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.69,1:09:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太好，奶奶长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good, Granny sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.99,1:09:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.50,1:09:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜水！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dive, dive, dive!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.71,1:10:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.61,1:10:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰死你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Booyah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.68,1:10:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太舒服了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.12,1:10:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，鲸鱼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mister Whale.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.15,1:10:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼尼 - 希德！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Manny. - Sid!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.35,1:10:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.56,1:10:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.06,1:10:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,别，桃桃，我去救你妈妈，你待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Peaches, l'll get your mother. You stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.36,1:10:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.07,1:10:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,该算账了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payback time.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.90,1:10:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.14,1:10:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾丽！ - 我能行，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ellie! - I got this, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.47,1:10:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃桃，别！太危险了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches, no! Lt's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.04,1:10:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一半负鼠血统我怕谁！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you're half-possum!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.03,1:10:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.23,1:11:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿真的长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter's all grown up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.84,1:11:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.91,1:11:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.58,1:11:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走，快走，我来掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.15,1:11:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.31,1:11:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我来‘掩护’你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.78,1:11:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.93,1:11:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.43,1:11:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经穷途末路了，曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nowhere to run, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.31,1:11:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道，一海不容二主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this ocean isn't big enough for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.81,1:11:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.98,1:11:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我把你压扁了，你就不占空间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't take up much space once I flatten you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.90,1:12:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你，肥仔…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, tubby…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.33,1:12:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该惹恼我这海上霸王\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shouldn't have messed with the Master of the Seas.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.77,1:12:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候，体重11吨也是有好处的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sometimes, it pays to weigh eleven tons!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.44,1:12:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.64,1:12:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路顺风，猴仔！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bon voyage, monkey boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.55,1:12:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人召唤鲸鱼了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did somebody hail a whale?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.26,1:12:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是珍珍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you must be Precious.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.50,1:12:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,任务完成，奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mission accomplished, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.10,1:12:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁说老太不能驾驶的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says old ladies can't drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.31,1:13:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,肚黑船长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Captain Gutt!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.99,1:13:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.25,1:13:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起称霸四海吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's rule the seas together.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.06,1:13:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, aye.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.64,1:13:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.41,1:13:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个出场如何啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that for an entrance?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.82,1:13:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.19,1:13:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.49,1:13:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了你爸不会抛弃我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you your father would never give up on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.16,1:13:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.96,1:13:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上，我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I actually…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.30,1:13:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Sid…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.70,1:13:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不算一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not such a screw-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.84,1:13:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？ - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.91,1:13:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.71,1:14:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是，奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.18,1:14:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.78,1:14:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想要我加入你们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, still want me on your scurvy crew?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.55,1:14:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，欢迎加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet. Welcome to our herd.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.25,1:14:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.52,1:14:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你会为我挺身而出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you did that for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.26,1:14:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.76,1:14:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人曾说，无论如何…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone once told me, no matter what…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.13,1:14:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不能抛弃朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never leave a friend behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.33,1:14:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的牙都快被你们甜倒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this sweetness is going to rot my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.37,1:14:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had any.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.81,1:14:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的家园没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our home is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.94,1:14:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.63,1:14:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈也爱你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Momma loves you, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.03,1:15:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我恨不得马上把这里探个究竟 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't wait to check this place out. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.73,1:15:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思？ - 爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.40,1:15:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们下了船之后，我希望你们俩个都…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you two get off this ship, I expect you both to…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.04,1:15:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩得高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}have fun.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.24,1:15:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很勇敢，小样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a brave kid, Weiner.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.54,1:15:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.95,1:15:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没听错，你们应该出去体验大千世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me. You two should go out and explore.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.82,1:15:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,白天出去走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where the day takes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.28,1:15:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但日落之前得回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But be back before sunset.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.82,1:15:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,日落后一小时可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour after sunset?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.99,1:15:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一分钟都不能迟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not a minute later.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.26,1:15:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.96,1:15:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你，爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.50,1:16:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们和你们一道可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay if we hang with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.13,1:16:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.30,1:16:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直挺喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always liked him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.97,1:16:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,英雄路易斯，英勇无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louis the hero. Brave-a-licious.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.01,1:16:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不再是我的那个小女孩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not my little girl anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.81,1:16:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're both going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.51,1:16:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.35,1:16:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗，希德？在这儿你找到了一个温暖的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Sidney? You've got yourself a nice family, here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.09,1:16:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个真正的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A real family.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.36,1:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，我很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm pretty lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.06,1:16:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着，帮我嚼嚼这个狝猴桃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, chew this kiwi for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.43,1:16:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.20,1:16:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.94,1:16:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好，水手 - 哇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, sailor. - Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.18,1:17:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎，兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.19,1:17:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，奎特兰蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, Scratlantis.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.81,1:18:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.62,1:18:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.22,1:18:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟，超脱于本能欲望之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother, rise above this base desire.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.39,1:18:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再当一只低下的老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be more than a rodent.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.47,1:19:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们，我们不是真正的一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, we are Not your ordinary fam-a, ma-lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.31,1:19:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can all agree that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.94,1:19:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们，我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.25,1:19:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲密无间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close as close can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.82,1:19:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,太亲密了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too close!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.22,1:19:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are are are are are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.25,1:19:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.82,1:19:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are are are are are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.66,1:19:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.62,1:19:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are are are are are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.56,1:19:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.29,1:19:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.20,1:19:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.40,1:19:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,长相不同没关系，一切于我已完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it don't matter what it looks like We look perfect to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.23,1:20:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们满满都是爱，我就是幸运星\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got every kind of love I feel so lucky indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.47,1:20:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可以一直说，我也不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can keep on talkin' lt don't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.68,1:20:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we are, we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.85,1:20:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.65,1:20:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.75,1:20:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.45,1:20:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,火腿和芝士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ham and cheese.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.59,1:20:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对，是“我们是一家人”\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's, "We are family."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.82,1:20:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间的联系将彼此拉得更紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay so the links in our chain Makes us strain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.43,1:20:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也使我们变得更坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really they make us stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.10,1:20:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿什么也不换，妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wouldn't replace not a thing Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.77,1:20:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或爸爸 - 去吧，曼尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or father. - Go, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.17,1:20:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.47,1:20:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们来自四面八方\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause we come from everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.17,1:20:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,共觅栖息之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching for ones to care.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.88,1:20:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我们找到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somehow we found it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.11,1:20:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了家园\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found us a home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.02,1:20:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们，我们不是真正的一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, we are Not your ordinary fam-a, ma-lee.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.66,1:20:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can all agree that.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.22,1:20:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are, we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.83,1:21:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲密无间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close as close can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.70,1:21:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are are are are are.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.57,1:21:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
